rxscene 1

# Corrugated industrial shed: vertical ribs, a roller door, a shallow roof cap.
# The ribs are the whole material, and they only read as ribs because the
# pattern counts 40 cells across and 1 up - which is a thing the scale could not
# say at all while it was one number.

